                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e3e5422c-b1f9-4229-b5bb-5d87ad7f3d96",
                        "source_entry_id": "d09bc64a-0fe6-3db7-ade2-3792889666bb",
                        "source_sense_id": "23873bcc-5571-3235-86f2-731f46999406",
                        "target_lang_word": "self-abuse",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "self-abuse",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1badabc-84f9-301f-a162-074faa7c8afc",
                                        "entry_id": "dafe3a40-d540-30aa-9b2c-7a426afc59c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Self-deception."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2aca2b55-27a0-4e92-9391-d1af62ab593e",
                                                "sense_id": "c1badabc-84f9-301f-a162-074faa7c8afc",
                                                "text": "Come, wee’l to ſleepe: My ſtrange & ſelf-abuſe\nIs the initiate feare, that wants hard vse:\nWe are yet but yong indeed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "99da42b1-a2fa-3461-8b3e-a90c4679fd15",
                                        "entry_id": "dafe3a40-d540-30aa-9b2c-7a426afc59c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Physical or verbal maltreatment of oneself."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "579147df-fa16-4fc4-8c9b-473266374d5e",
                                                "sense_id": "99da42b1-a2fa-3461-8b3e-a90c4679fd15",
                                                "text": "No man hath any warrant for self-abuse: We are not nostri, sed alieni juris; and God will see we shall not destroy his work besides his will."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9806d087-88d5-3ff5-8101-523fce431345",
                                        "entry_id": "dafe3a40-d540-30aa-9b2c-7a426afc59c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Physical or verbal maltreatment of oneself.",
                                            "Injury inflicted deliberately upon oneself, especially resulting from a mental disorder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1bae5def-f1c9-495e-9e9c-3623e86371de",
                                                "sense_id": "9806d087-88d5-3ff5-8101-523fce431345",
                                                "text": "If such conversion surgery is not readily available, which is normally the case, owing to the many legal dangers attendant to the operation(s), the transsexual may well attempt self-castration, other mutilations and even suicide, or fall into a reactive psychosis. Such self-abuse is apparently not at all rare."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1bf14a47-664e-41ec-a1bb-646edf3d31bb",
                                                "sense_id": "9806d087-88d5-3ff5-8101-523fce431345",
                                                "text": "Well I lost control and hurt myself\nI knew deep down that I needed some help\nThis self-abuse, it would not stop,\nNo matter how hard I tried"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69b05338-6c2d-324a-8d07-5246563ff9e5",
                                        "entry_id": "dafe3a40-d540-30aa-9b2c-7a426afc59c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Masturbation, regarded as sinful or harmful."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "dated",
                                            "euphemistic",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35eeebb0-42ff-4b5b-9107-79743afcd4f7",
                                                "sense_id": "69b05338-6c2d-324a-8d07-5246563ff9e5",
                                                "text": "For which reaſon it is that a Gleet is always more or leſs difficult to Cure, as it is of greater or leſs Continuance, or is occaſioned by more or leſs Frequent ſelf Abuſes, or a more or leſs virulent Humor which gave the preceeding Infect∣ion; by every one of which cauſes the Glands are always more or leſs ſtretched, weakned and debilitated"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b240626e-f6c5-40f7-b6e7-ac396c770078",
                                                "sense_id": "69b05338-6c2d-324a-8d07-5246563ff9e5",
                                                "text": "The vice consists in any excitement of the genital organs produced otherwise than in the natural way. It is known by the terms, self-pollution, self-abuse, masturbation, onanism, manustupration, voluntary pollution, solitary or secret vice, and other names sufficiently explanatory."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bf06085-09d4-4565-913a-4652cb90ae72",
                                                "sense_id": "69b05338-6c2d-324a-8d07-5246563ff9e5",
                                                "text": "Self-abuse is undoubtedly an evil in itself, because it is incomplete and unnatural, and sad is his state who has bound himself with the chains this vice can so deftly forge; but its chief danger is that it so quickly and easily becomes a habit, and then it is indulged beyond the power of the body to recuperate."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "self-abuse",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0180f2a3-fbf3-3f87-92d6-3529901cea7a",
                                        "entry_id": "ffc62ffe-edac-34de-bb1b-5d7cf0295031",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To harm oneself."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bbb3c09a-36f2-3803-a01a-fdc17e4f6ee3",
                                        "entry_id": "ffc62ffe-edac-34de-bb1b-5d7cf0295031",
